8. BUGS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FIXED  ECTS deadband, bank0 F77C (OBD2 address): cmpb <$03 (compare with RAM $0003) should be cmpb #$03.
       $0003 is the current-DTC byte for P0216/P0218-P0223/P0225. With none of those set the deadband
       is 0, so ECTS_DIR_FILTERED (idle RPM vs ECT input) only follows coolant up, never down.
       Fix: F77C D1 -> C1, ROM checksum $D7C1 -> $D7B1. Patched in the OBD2 code only: filter RAM $19DB,
       coolant_temp $1929, DTC byte from this bin's table at $50EB. OBD1 has the same bug in extended form
       (cmpb >L0003, 3 bytes) - used only to recognise the pattern.
